<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Hewlett-Packard.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Hewlett-Packard.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Hambrecht &amp; Quist Wednesday cut its fiscal 1997 estimate to $2.95 a share from $3.05 a share, citing lower profit margins, slightly lower sales growth and cost containment challenges.</p>
<p>-- In a research report H&amp;Q said it is forecasting sales growth of 15 pct to 16 pct for fiscal 1997, at the low end of the range of guidance. Year to date sales growth comparisons are expected to be difficult for the first half of fiscal 1997.</p>
<p>-- Noted printer market remains competitive with aggressive pricing at the low end. Concerned that excess channel inventory in consumer PC's could hurt sales.</p>
</text>
